     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "羅茲集團軍司令",
      "en": "Commander, Lodz Army"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "美國陸軍戰史稱，羅梅爾少將指揮五個步兵師與兩個騎兵旅，守備羅茲地區，即羅茲集團軍。波蘭方面的 IPN 文章指出，德軍強大的裝甲部隊攻擊羅茲集團軍（羅梅爾將軍）與克拉科夫集團軍（希林將軍）的接合處，後來裝甲楔形攻勢撕裂了羅茲集團軍。IPN 另一篇文章說，羅梅爾在司令部遭轟炸後離開了這個集團軍。",
      "en": "The US Army history says Maj. Gen. Rommel commanded five infantry divisions and two cavalry brigades holding the Lodz area, the Lodz Army. An IPN article says powerful German armour struck the junction of the Lodz Army (Gen. Rómmel) and the Krakow Army (Gen. Szylling), and that an armoured wedge later tore the Lodz Army apart. Another IPN article says Rómmel left the army after its staff was bombed."
     },
