     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "華沙集團軍司令",
      "en": "Commander, Warsaw Army"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "IPN 的日曆條目把1939年9月8日列為羅梅爾出任新編華沙集團軍指揮官之日，該集團軍的任務包括防衛首都。IPN 另一篇文章稱，他在同一天已抵達華沙；該集團軍由退到華沙的殘部組成。華沙防衛司令則由瓦萊里安·楚馬將軍擔任。",
      "en": "An IPN calendar entry places 8 September 1939 as the day Rómmel took command of the newly formed Warsaw Army, whose task included defending the capital. Another IPN article says he was already in Warsaw that day, and that the army was formed from remnants that reached the city. Gen. Walerian Czuma served as commander of the defence of Warsaw."
     },
